{"data":{"id":"MGJlG98hFgw","slug":"mara-hruby","title":"Mara Hruby","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"EROPs3aYQ2o","slug":"the-panties","title":"The Panties"}]},"markers":[{"id":"YnlrEl1CK7o","position":34,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mara Hruby - The Panties","track":{"id":"EROPs3aYQ2o","path":"/artists/mara-hruby/tracks/the-panties/","slug":"the-panties","title":"The Panties","artist":{"slug":"mara-hruby","title":"Mara Hruby"},"artwork":"images/artists/mara-hruby/tracks/the-panties.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PQcEHD74TwM","slug":"141","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-141-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #141 w/ Colta (Team Supreme)","artwork":"/images/episodes/141.jpg","content":"\nColta from Team Supreme drops a set to promote the (Team Supreme x Soulection Takeover @ The Echo)\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10821,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-17T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kays Set","position":2}},{"id":"cpUxY1VtNEE","position":23,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mara Hruby - The Panties","track":{"id":"EROPs3aYQ2o","path":"/artists/mara-hruby/tracks/the-panties/","slug":"the-panties","title":"The Panties","artist":{"slug":"mara-hruby","title":"Mara Hruby"},"artwork":"images/artists/mara-hruby/tracks/the-panties.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"NucnmMuy7oA","position":72,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mara Hruby - The Panties","track":{"id":"EROPs3aYQ2o","path":"/artists/mara-hruby/tracks/the-panties/","slug":"the-panties","title":"The Panties","artist":{"slug":"mara-hruby","title":"Mara Hruby"},"artwork":"images/artists/mara-hruby/tracks/the-panties.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"nbke6-Mfddk","slug":"161","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-161"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #161","artwork":"/images/episodes/161.jpg","content":"Joe focuses on new tracks from forthcoming Soulection releases.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nJoe also announced some hints about what to expect in the coming months. We have so much in store for you. \nWe're only a couple of weeks in to the new year and already we feel like we have hit some milestones. \n\nStay tuned. \n\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10868,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"5d05wzumVQU","position":85,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mara Hruby - The Panties","track":{"id":"EROPs3aYQ2o","path":"/artists/mara-hruby/tracks/the-panties/","slug":"the-panties","title":"The Panties","artist":{"slug":"mara-hruby","title":"Mara Hruby"},"artwork":"images/artists/mara-hruby/tracks/the-panties.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"KGbt4wCudfQ","slug":"168","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-168-sxsw"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #168 (SXSW Pre Show)","artwork":"/images/episodes/168.jpg","content":"Joe kay getting you ready for SXSW.\n<!--more-->\n\nAs we are getting ready for SXSW we wanted to get you in the spirit. Joe Kay went solo again to keep things simple and focused. He kicked it off with the new Carmack/Esta collab, played some new discoveries/unreleased gems, and then switched up the whole format by letting the live listener selects the music by sending us our requests via our social media networks. What a beautiful thing! For over 2 hours, you had the chance to selects the music, Joe was just the provider! What a great way to collaborate right? Since we will be at SXSW from (March 11-16) there won't be a live Soulection Radio show next week, however, we do have a special guest mix to make up for it. Stay tuned.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10818,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"sSXZt2__ELc","position":33,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Mara Hruby - The Panties","track":{"id":"EROPs3aYQ2o","path":"/artists/mara-hruby/tracks/the-panties/","slug":"the-panties","title":"The Panties","artist":{"slug":"mara-hruby","title":"Mara Hruby"},"artwork":"images/artists/mara-hruby/tracks/the-panties.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"ds5J8Q4FpEQ","slug":"174","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-174-w-iman-omari"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #174 w/ Iman Omari","artwork":"/images/episodes/174.jpg","content":"Playing many tracks across 4 Sets\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":11043,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-0